ce_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bRoO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce8b580f-a64f-4673-8c06-d169761870fa","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"私はforce pushしましたの札をかけないと","ts":"1629456491.063200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9uJ8T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87cdda0a-46ab-449f-bc2e-703cef95306c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"pushさえしてなければresetするだけで済むはず(~しててもforce pushしたらいいだけだけど~)","ts":"1629456457.062800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+5fU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d541c695-31f9-4769-a689-aadd4c1edf76","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"GHAの履歴からcommit hash無理矢理持って来れないです？","ts":"1629456406.062100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zea8A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d119248-81f4-4da1-8953-86783815c7d4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"pushしてしまった？","ts":"1629456354.061600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GH4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"845a4214-10f0-43ca-b03a-24ee6dccffc5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"今こんな感じです\n```1. release -\u0026gt; developへのmerge branchを作成\n2. merge branch \u0026lt;- developをマージ\n  1. コンフリクト修正してコミット\n3. merge branchの元であるreleaseで追加コミット発生したので、merge branchにreleaseをマージ\n4. merge branchとdevelopのコンフリクトを再度修正\n5. merge branch -\u0026gt; developにマージ\n6. merge branch -\u0026gt; releaseにマージ\n7. release にいくつかのコミットとマージが追加される \u0026lt;-- 今ここ\n\nやりたいこと\n6でmerge branchをマージしてしまったので、それをrevertしたい\n\ngit revert -m 1 {merge commit hash} すれば良いというところまでわかった```","ts":"1629456313.061300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Opo1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7892eaf-b6c9-410e-b121-d86561bbc997","type":"message","user":"U8996GYB